A few other ideas:

Some monsters are also light sources (could be helpful on the plane of 
fire).

A lamp or lantern (but not a candle) will stay lit when you throw it. 
I've used that trick a time or two. It looks like A well placed lamp 
would be good for two expert jumps too, but you'd have to leave it behind.

The interesting thing about candles (which I recalled reading in some 
spoiler long ago, but just now tested) is they start with a radius of 2 
but it goes up by 1 for very power of 7 candles in the stack. So a stack 
of 7 candles is the same as a lamp, or unskilled jumping. If you can get 
49 of the same kind of candle together somehow that gives you a radius 
of 4, the same as expert jumping.

